        h1 Zahna Woodson

        p Full Stack JavaScript Developer


        .about-bio

          p Zahna is a strategist, organizer, and cultural curator dedicated to dismantling systemic inequalities and creating empowering spaces for intentionally marginalized communities. With a background in nonprofit work, public policy, and advocacy, Zahna has built a career at the intersection of technology, organizing, and the arts.
          p Grounded in a mission to disrupt oppressive structures and champion a future led by historically excluded voices, Zahna’s work, shaped by a legacy of resilience as a descendant of the Great Migration, bridges technology, advocacy, and grassroots organizing and is rooted in a deep commitment to community empowerment, technological equity, and intersectional justice.


